{"document":{"type":"root","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"The "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"ActiveLinkOptions"},{"type":"text","value":" type extends the "},{"type":"link","href":"./LinkOptionsType.md","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"LinkOptions"}]},{"type":"text","value":" type and contains additional options that can be used to describe how a link should be styled when it is active."}]},{"type":"code","value":"type ActiveLinkOptions = LinkOptions & {\n  activeProps?:\n    | React.AnchorHTMLAttributes<HTMLAnchorElement>\n    | (() => React.AnchorHTMLAttributes<HTMLAnchorElement>)\n  inactiveProps?:\n    | React.AnchorHTMLAttributes<HTMLAnchorElement>\n    | (() => React.AnchorHTMLAttributes<HTMLAnchorElement>)\n}","lang":"tsx"},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"activelinkoptions-properties","children":[{"type":"text","value":"ActiveLinkOptions properties"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"The "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"ActiveLinkOptions"},{"type":"text","value":" object accepts/contains the following properties:"}]},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"activeprops","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"activeProps"}]},{"type":"list","ordered":false,"items":[{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"React.AnchorHTMLAttributes<HTMLAnchorElement>"}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Optional"}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"The props that will be applied to the anchor element when the link is active"}]}]}]},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"inactiveprops","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"inactiveProps"}]},{"type":"list","ordered":false,"items":[{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Type: "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"React.AnchorHTMLAttributes<HTMLAnchorElement>"}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Optional"}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"The props that will be applied to the anchor element when the link is inactive"}]}]}]}],"headings":[{"id":"activelinkoptions-properties","text":"ActiveLinkOptions properties","level":2},{"id":"activeprops","text":"activeProps","level":3},{"id":"inactiveprops","text":"inactiveProps","level":3}]},"frameworks":[],"downloadMarkdown":"\nThe `ActiveLinkOptions` type extends the [`LinkOptions`](./LinkOptionsType.md) type and contains additional options that can be used to describe how a link should be styled when it is active.\n\n```tsx\ntype ActiveLinkOptions = LinkOptions & {\n  activeProps?:\n    | React.AnchorHTMLAttributes<HTMLAnchorElement>\n    | (() => React.AnchorHTMLAttributes<HTMLAnchorElement>)\n  inactiveProps?:\n    | React.AnchorHTMLAttributes<HTMLAnchorElement>\n    | (() => React.AnchorHTMLAttributes<HTMLAnchorElement>)\n}\n```\n\n## ActiveLinkOptions properties\n\nThe `ActiveLinkOptions` object accepts/contains the following properties:\n\n### `activeProps`\n\n- `React.AnchorHTMLAttributes<HTMLAnchorElement>`\n- Optional\n- The props that will be applied to the anchor element when the link is active\n\n### `inactiveProps`\n\n- Type: `React.AnchorHTMLAttributes<HTMLAnchorElement>`\n- Optional\n- The props that will be applied to the anchor element when the link is inactive\n","originalRawMarkdown":"---\nid: ActiveLinkOptionsType\ntitle: ActiveLinkOptions type\n---\n\nThe `ActiveLinkOptions` type extends the [`LinkOptions`](./LinkOptionsType.md) type and contains additional options that can be used to describe how a link should be styled when it is active.\n\n```tsx\ntype ActiveLinkOptions = LinkOptions & {\n  activeProps?:\n    | React.AnchorHTMLAttributes<HTMLAnchorElement>\n    | (() => React.AnchorHTMLAttributes<HTMLAnchorElement>)\n  inactiveProps?:\n    | React.AnchorHTMLAttributes<HTMLAnchorElement>\n    | (() => React.AnchorHTMLAttributes<HTMLAnchorElement>)\n}\n```\n\n## ActiveLinkOptions properties\n\nThe `ActiveLinkOptions` object accepts/contains the following properties:\n\n### `activeProps`\n\n- `React.AnchorHTMLAttributes<HTMLAnchorElement>`\n- Optional\n- The props that will be applied to the anchor element when the link is active\n\n### `inactiveProps`\n\n- Type: `React.AnchorHTMLAttributes<HTMLAnchorElement>`\n- Optional\n- The props that will be applied to the anchor element when the link is inactive\n"}
